5.4.2 paren_find
----------------

Name: (FIND)

   Stackeffect: addr1 addr2 -- pfa b tf (ok) addr1 addr2 .-- ff (bad)

   Attributes:

   Description: Searches the dictionary starting at the name field
address ADDR2, matching to the text at ADDR1. Returns parameter field
address, length byte of name field and boolean true for a good match.
If no match is found, only a boolean false is left.

   See also: `FIND'


File: fig86.msdos32.info,  Node: comma,  Next: -FIND,  Prev: paren_find,  Up: DICTIONARY

5.4.3 comma
-----------

Name: ,

   Stackeffect: n --

