File: fig86.msdos32.info,  Node: <#,  Next: BASE,  Prev: +-,  Up: FORMATTING

5.7.6 <#
--------

Name: <#

   No stackeffect

   Attributes: L0

   Description: Setup for pictured numeric output formatting using the
words:    `<#'  `#'  `#S'  `SIGN'  `#>' 

   The conversion is done on a double number producing text at `PAD'  .

   See also: `DPL' `HLD' `HOLD' `FLD'


File: fig86.msdos32.info,  Node: BASE,  Next: D+-,  Prev: <#,  Up: FORMATTING

