5.8 INIT
========

The wordset INIT contains words to initialise or reinitialise Forth.

* Menu:



* (ABORT)  :paren_abort
* +ORIGIN  ::
* ABORT  ::
* COLD  ::
* QUIT  ::
* WARM  ::


