number.

   See also: `WARM'


File: fig86.msdos32.info,  Node: COLD,  Next: QUIT,  Prev: ABORT,  Up: INIT

5.8.4 COLD
----------

Name: COLD

   No stackeffect

   Attributes: FIG

   Description: The cold start proceedure to adjust all user variables
