5.10 JUGGLING
=============

The wordset JUGGLING contains words that change the lifo-buffer.  The
necessity for this arise, because the data you want to feed to a program
is not directly accessible, i.e. on top of the stack.  It also possible
that  you need the same data twice, because you have to feed it to two
different program's.  Design your program such that you need them as
little as possible, because they are confusing.

* Menu:



* -DUP  ::
* 2DUP  ::
* DROP  ::
* DUP  ::
* OVER  ::
* ROT  ::
* SWAP  ::


