5.16.13 u_dot
-------------

Name: U.

   Stackeffect: u --

   Attributes: L0

   Description: Print a number from a unsigned 32 bit value, converted
according to the numeric `BASE'  .  A trailing blanks

   follows.

   See also: `OUT' `.' `.R' `D.R' `D.'


