5.19 SECURITY
=============

The wordset SECURITY contains words that are used by control words to
abort with an error message if the control structure is not correct.
Some say that this is not Forth-like.  You only need to know them if
want to extend the CONTROL wordset.

* Menu:



* !CSP  ::
* ?COMP  ::
* ?CSP  ::
* ?EXEC  ::
* ?LOADING  ::
* ?PAIRS  ::
* ?STACK  ::
* CSP  ::


