5.21.5 BLOCK-EXIT
-----------------

Name: BLOCK-EXIT

   Stackeffect: --

   Attributes:

   Description: A block file must have been opened by `BLOCK-INIT'  .
Close the currently open block file `BLOCK-HANDLE' , i.e. the mass
storage words no longer work, and will result in error messages.

   See also: `BLOCK' `LIST' `LOAD'


